    "Counts physical successful DMA-path releases by checked native instruction signature, not by counters or duration. Every counted request-to-release range is inside physical VBlank, with its native held-bus beam read independently checked against frame/time/HV tables. No Z80 sample occurs after that guard read before release; an in-flight instruction can finish between BUSREQ and BUSACK.",
